I’m not sure about excluding the x1:x1, x2:x2 plots, etc., but the rethinking package provides an easy pairs plot:
d <- data.frame(x1=rnorm(10), x2=rnorm(10),  x3=rnorm(10),x4=rnorm(10))
rethinking::pairs(d)
​

