From ua2bfdf24157fa01a at groups.google.com  Sat Apr 29 21:53:14 2017
From: ua2bfdf24157fa01a at groups.google.com (Matt Espe)
Date: Sat, 29 Apr 2017 21:53:14 +0000
Subject: Re: [D-RUG]: Writing Mixed Models?
Message-ID: <a6rTGVS82zA.BLRBTOFTBAAJ@davis-rug.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <a6rTGVS82zA.6KeAzin1AwAJ@davis-rug.groups.google.com>
References: <a6rTGVS82zA.YnBMRD2oAwAJ@davis-rug.groups.google.com> <a6rTGVS82zA.6KeAzin1AwAJ@davis-rug.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/davis-rug/c/a6rTGVS82zA/m/BLRBTOFTBAAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
